Many summaries under 120. Product detail meta descriptions would be under target. Design says 120-160. We should make product detail description at least 120 by appending a consistent suffix, e.g. `" ${product.summary} Lihat detail dan konsultasikan kebutuhan lembaga Anda."` But that might exceed 160 for 130 + 50 = 180. Need a helper that pads/truncates to 120-160.

Implement `productMetaDescription(product)`:
```ts
const suffix = " Konsultasi kebutuhan lembaga Anda dengan Kampung IT Solo.";
const description = product ? `${product.summary}${suffix}` : fallback;
```
Lengths: 91+58=149, 130+58=188. Need cap at 160. Truncate at word boundary:
```ts
function metaDescription(summary: string) {
 const suffix = " Konsultasi kebutuhan lembaga Anda dengan Kampung IT Solo.";
 const combined = `${summary}${suffix}`;
 if (combined.length <= 160) return combined;
 return `${combined.slice(0, 157).replace(/\s+\S*$/, "")}...`; // may produce ~155
}
```
But truncating may cut; for 130 summary + suffix, first 157 chars includes summary + part of suffix; fine. Need at least 120. All summaries >=91, plus suffix 58 => >=149; capped 157. Good.
Better use product-specific: `"${product.summary} Konsultasi kebutuhan lembaga Anda bersama Kampung IT Solo."` length suffix 69; 91+69=160, 130+69=199 -> cap.
Implement in `$slug.tsx`:
```ts
const PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION_SUFFIX = " Konsultasi kebutuhan lembaga Anda bersama Kampung IT Solo.";
function productDescription(summary: string) {
 const combined = `${summary}${PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION_SUFFIX}`;
 if (combined.length <= 160) return combined;
 return `${combined.slice(0, 157).replace(/\s+\S*$/, "")}...`;
}
```
For 91 summary: 91+1+68? Count suffix ~57. Let's count:
" Konsultasi kebutuhan lembaga Anda bersama Kampung IT Solo." = 62? Let's compute. 91+62=153. Good. 130+62=192 -> truncate at 157 -> maybe 157, then ellipsis 160. Fine.
Meta description max 160, min 149. Good.

Should we also ensure `/products` title & descriptions; fine.
Home description 122.
Product detail title length: product names + suffix; e.g. "ELFAN Solar Energi H | Kampung IT Solo" 40; fine.
Smart School etc. <60.

Implement helper in `$slug.tsx`. Also `pageHead` description fallback. Add function above Route.
```ts
function productDescription(summary: string) { ... }
```
Use `description: product ? productDescription(product.summary) : ...`.
This is a small SEO improvement within acceptance. Apply.

Also check `/products` product page descriptions? Only meta. Fine.

Let's edit.

